        "formula": "|L-\\|f\\|^2|\\le\\frac{\\omega}{2\\gamma}\\|f\\|^2\\le\\frac12\\|f\\|^2,\\quad\\frac12\\|f\\|^2\\le L\\le\\frac32\\|f\\|^2.",
